    <string name="fusion_warn_bullets">\u2022 You can still play the game and use most mods and mod packs.\n\u2022 Not every mod will work: plugin mods that need Fusion will not run.\n\u2022 You can turn Fusion back on in Settings, but the game may crash.</string>
